WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.068
-Welcome back to "Late Night."

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:03.502
Facebook has come under
fire recently

00:00:03.502 --> 00:00:05.604
for spreading misinformation
and for reportedly

00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:07.840
triggering depression
and anxiety,

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.074
particularly among young women.

00:00:09.074 --> 00:00:11.677
One person we haven't heard
all that much from

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:14.680
is Facebook's chief operating
officer, Sheryl Sandberg.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.716
please welcome her to the show.

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.818
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:25.091
-Thank you, Seth, for giving me
the opportunity to comment,

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.660
or as we like to say
at Facebook,

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.596
the opportunity to comment.

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:31.097
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:33.499
-So, there's been so much
negative press

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:35.101
surrounding Facebook.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.836
By the way, should I be calling
it Meta?

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:40.439
-Oh, no. We have no expectation
that anyone will ever do that.

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:41.975
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.375
So, with regards
to Facebook then,

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:44.777
let me begin by asking --

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:47.213
-Well, first, Seth,
I just want to say

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.882
that I am a woman.

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:51.551
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:54.254
-And as a woman...

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:56.356
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:02.395
I am a daughter.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:04.330
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:10.637
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:15.074
And as a daughter...

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:17.243
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:27.954
I am also the mother
of a daughter, a girl.

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:29.588
-Okay, you know, I think
we get --

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:33.692
-A sister of someone's
mother's daughter.

00:01:33.692 --> 00:01:36.128
-Uh-huh.
-The proud granddaughter

00:01:36.128 --> 00:01:42.902
of a lady who is also a sister,
a niece, an aunt and a wife.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.270
-Can we get back to Facebook?

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.105
-Sure, sure, but Seth...

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:48.340
-Mm-hmm.
-...Seth, as a woman

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:50.443
in the workforce...
-Uh-huh.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:53.680
-...I am a female who strives
to make her sister's

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.782
mom's aunt prouder
than if it were her own

00:01:56.782 --> 00:01:58.585
daughter's cousin's girl child.

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:00.519
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.519 --> 00:02:02.622
-So about the specific
allegations

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.523
that Facebook executives
knowingly --

00:02:04.523 --> 00:02:09.061
-Godmothers, stepmothers
and all mothers can experience

00:02:09.061 --> 00:02:11.764
what it means to be
a working career woman.

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:15.702
Along with our single sisters,
daughters, girl cousins,

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:19.472
nieces, aunts, brothers'
sisters, stepsisters,

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:24.243
half sisters, husbands' wives
and wives' wives.

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:28.647
ladies who lunch
but also ladies who brunch.

00:02:28.647 --> 00:02:31.551
In other words, women.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:33.119
Women.

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:35.321
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:41.360
-Okay.
-Great. Great.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.429
And Seth, don't forget
to share this clip

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:45.397
on Facebook and Instagram.

00:02:45.397 --> 00:02:47.800
And, uh...

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.068
lean in, will you?

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:51.838
-Okay.
Sheryl Sandberg, everyone.

